The router interface, the orchestrator, the built-in test router, the
Specctra DSN writer and the SES reader are original work written for this
package from the public Specctra format description. No code from KiCad,
Freerouting or any other GPL or proprietary tool is included.

The tscircuit adapter runs @tscircuit/capacity-autorouter
(https://github.com/tscircuit/tscircuit-autorouter, MIT License,
Copyright (c) tscircuit contributors) in a worker thread and converts to and
from its published SimpleRouteJson input format; it is a dependency, not
copied code.

Freerouting (https://github.com/freerouting/freerouting) is GPL-3.0. It is
never bundled or linked: the user installs it, and this package only runs
it as a separate program and reads the session file it writes.
